# The tests of the PostgreSQL database (see config.libxle.test.pgsql).

: migrate
: Test that migrating creates only our schema and then finds it current
:
: The ODB schema catalog is process-wide and also has the schemas of the
: libraries we link (libobe), which must be neither created nor versioned
: with ours.
:
if ($pgsql != [null])
{
  $* $pgsql >>EOO
  migrated 0
  migrated 1
  tables 2
  versions 1
  version xle 1
  table relationship 1
  table schema_version 1
  EOO
}
